DESCRIPTION:National Sandwich Day falls on November 3 and honors the most u
 nremarkable food in the American lunch rotation: a filling between two pie
 ces of bread\, named for an eighteenth-century British politician who almo
 st certainly did not invent it. The observance has no documented founder\,
  and the explanation usually given for its date does not survive a look at
  the record.\n\nhttps://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/national-sandwich-day/
